$TITLE  TIMES.jl reference run -- {RUN_NAME}
* Adapted from xl2times' gams_scaffold/scenario.run (etsap-TIMES/xl2times),
* which its CI uses to run benchmark models from DD files. Settings are
* unchanged so that references match the way such models are normally run.
